@startuml KTOB_01_use_cases
title KTOB - Reader Use Cases (R1)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Reader
actor "Open Library [EXT]" as Catalog
actor "Groq [V3 qualification]" as AI
actor "Seller source [BLOCKED]" as Seller
rectangle "KTOB" {
 usecase "Sign in / register" as UAuth
 usecase "Manage consent, profile\nand content boundaries" as UPrivacy
 usecase "Search catalog" as USearch
 usecase "Create private manual work" as UManual
 usecase "Add work to own library" as UAdd
 usecase "Archive or restore library entry" as UArchive
 usecase "Manage favorite / acquisition intent" as UFavorite
 usecase "Create and manage collections" as UCollect
 usecase "Read collection members" as UMembers
 usecase "Start reading / reread / import past reading" as URead
 usecase "Write / exclude journal entry" as UJournal
 usecase "Discuss book or literature" as UChat
 usecase "Review memory proposal" as UMemory
 usecase "Explicit full-book spoiler authorization (per request)" as USpoiler
 usecase "Request recommendations" as URecommend
 usecase "Use permitted context" as UContext
 usecase "Apply content boundaries" as UBoundary
 usecase "Search for verified offers" as UFind
 usecase "Save observed offer" as USave
 usecase "Record acquisition explicitly" as UAcquire
 usecase "Export essential personal data" as UExport
}
Reader --> UAuth
Reader --> UPrivacy
Reader --> USearch
Reader --> UManual
Reader --> UAdd
Reader --> UArchive
Reader --> UFavorite
Reader --> UCollect
Reader --> UMembers
Reader --> URead
Reader --> UJournal
Reader --> UChat
Reader --> UMemory
Reader --> URecommend
Reader --> UFind
Reader --> USave
Reader --> UAcquire
Reader --> UExport
UContext ..> URecommend : <<extend>>\nwhen personalization authorized
UContext ..> UChat : <<extend>>\nwhen personalization authorized
USpoiler ..> UChat : <<extend>>\nexplicit FULL_BOOK_SPOILERS confirmation
USpoiler ..> URecommend : <<extend>>\nexplicit FULL_BOOK_SPOILERS confirmation
URecommend ..> UBoundary : <<include>>
Catalog --> USearch
AI --> UChat
AI --> URecommend
Seller --> UFind
note right of UAdd
Catalog search OR manual creation may precede add;
neither is mandatory for an existing known work.
A duplicate add returns 409.
end note
note bottom of UChat
AI processing consent gates every provider call, even generic chat.
Personalization consent is separate and optional;
per-entry journal exclusions always prevail.
NO_SPOILERS by default, regardless of AI consent.
V3 chat uses only question, minimal book metadata and permitted history.
Stored personalization, recommendations and memories remain planned.
end note
note bottom of UAcquire
Seller click / saving offer does not imply acquisition.
Acquisition does not change reading status.
end note
@enduml
